<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Seagate Technology.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Seagate Technology.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that Seagate Technology Inc was unavailable for after-hours trade for news.</p>
<p>The exchange also said that Corimon SACA and Buenos Aires Embotelladora were unavailable in after-hours trade.</p>
</text>
